      "lines": [
        "$\\left|\\frac{1}{7}-0.14\\right|<|0.15-0.14|$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "但是，$0.15-0.14=0.01$，因此，不等式",
        "$\\left|\\frac{1}{7}-0.14\\right|\\leqslant0.01$",
        "是真不等式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 在测量一块长方形土地的长度$a$和宽度$b$（以米为单",
        "位）时，得到$a=63.5\\pm0.1$，$b=85.3\\pm0.1$。求这块地的面",
        "积。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了计算这块地的面积$S$，我们要应用公式$S=ab$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为",
        "$63.4\\leqslant a\\leqslant63.6$，",
        "$85.2\\leqslant b\\leqslant85.4$，",
        "所以，根据不等式两边分别相乘的定理，有：",
        "$63.4\\cdot85.2\\leqslant ab\\leqslant63.6\\cdot85.4$，",
        "即",
        "$5401.68\\leqslant S\\leqslant5431.44$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "表示面积$S$的准确值的数，对于我们来说是未知的。但",
        "是很明显，它的千位数字是$5$，百位数字是$4$，十位数字是$0$，",
        "$1$，$2$或$3$当中的一个。至于个位数字（以及后边的所有数字），",
        "我们一般不能说出任何确定的结果。因此，把所求的面积$S$",
        "的界四舍五入到十位数字是合理的。用更小的数代替下界和",
        "用更大的数代替上界，得到：",
        "$5400\\leqslant S\\leqslant5440$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作为面积$S$的近似值，我们取上界和下界的算术平均"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
